<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: TENNIS-CZECH OPEN WOMEN'S QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-CZECH OPEN WOMEN'S QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter-final results from the Czech Open women's tennis tournament on Friday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Marion Maruska (Austria) beat 3-Karina Habsudova (Slovakia) 7-5 1-6 6-4</p>
<p>Joanette Kruger (South Africa) beat Alex Dechaume-Balleret (France) 4-6 7-6 (7-4) 6-1</p>
<p>Veronika Martinek (Germany) beat 5-Denisa Chladkova (Czech Republic) 6-4 6-0</p>
<p>Catalina Cristea (Romania) beat Ludmila Richterova (Czech Republic) 6-2 2-6 7-5</p>
</text>
